"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my RPG podcast: <a href=\"http://thestorytold.libsyn.com\" target=\"_blank\">The Story Told</a><br /> Follow my ongoing Exalted Campaign: <a href=\"https://thefallofjiara.obsidianportal.com/adventure-log\" target=\"_blank\">The Fall of Jiara</a><br /> Check out my Community Content: <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?author=Chazz%20Kellner\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse....hazz%20Kellner</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/702-elfspeaker","name":"ElfSpeaker","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar702_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-08T06:59:25-08:00","id":1279456,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ElfSpeaker</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1279418-scion-2e-demigod-official?p=1279452#post1279452\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I could potentially see the KS late this year or early next and the finished PDF in as little as 18 months.</div> </div> </div> </div>Wait, original KS for <b>Scion 2E</b> did not included <b>Demigod</b> and <b>God</b> corebooks? <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/eek.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"EEK!\" smilieid=\"9\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-08T07:05:22-08:00","id":1279457,"title":"","content":"No it didn&quot;t, it had option for getting the whole first edition but aside from that you only got Origins and Heroes","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12946-emerick","name":"Emerick","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12946_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"156"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-08T07:38:37-08:00","id":1279464,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1279418-scion-2e-demigod-official?p=1279456#post1279456\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Wait, original KS for <b>Scion 2E</b> did not included <b>Demigod</b> and <b>God</b> corebooks? <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/eek.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"EEK!\" smilieid=\"9\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>Pledging too many books to backers at once in a single Kickstarter is how you cut off future revenue flow and have to lay off your entire staff with still more promised books you\u2019re not going to see much new money on before you can get around to producing anything new to actually sell. Just ask John Wick Presents.<br /> <br /> Demigod and God will each get their own kickstarters with stretchgoals building supplements for each.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Anyway, one aspect to look forward to here with how Onyx Path kickstarters now work is that we\u2019ll get the full preview text for each book in their Kickstarter. So there is much less delay now till we get update material for our ongoing games.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-08T08:32:09-08:00","id":1279474,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Emerick</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1279418-scion-2e-demigod-official?p=1279457#post1279457\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">No it didn&quot;t, it had option for getting the whole first edition but aside from that you only got Origins and Heroes</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> And all of the reward levels were very clear you were getting Scion: Origins and Scion: Hero only. (Assuming you pledged for a level with both of them in it.)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8719-florin","name":"Florin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"940"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-08T14:49:02-08:00","id":1279569,"title":"","content":"Also one of the biggest element in the time it took to produce scion was designing the storypath system. (in conjunction with another game being made at roughly the same time).<br /> This simply isnt a concern for demigod and god.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Completed campaign: Scion 2nd Edition. Les L\u00e9gendes Currently playing: Being a dad for a 3 year old daughter and a 2 years old son and now a beautiful new baby.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11312-maitrecorbo","name":"Maitrecorbo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11312_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"719"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-08T19:53:33-08:00","id":1279634,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Maitrecorbo</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1279418-scion-2e-demigod-official?p=1279569#post1279569\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Also one of the biggest element in the time it took to produce scion was designing the storypath system. (in conjunction with another game being made at roughly the same time).<br /> This simply isnt a concern for demigod and god.</div> </div> </div> </div>However, WHOLE POINT of Scion 2E was that mechanics for Demigod and God to be fixed. I suspect, they need to put special care for playtesting those books when written.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-09T05:04:00-08:00","id":1279677,"title":"","content":"As we\u2019ve mentioned just so many times, Storypath was designed specifically to enable play at the sort of levels of power that are in Demigod and God (and Trinity Continuum: Aberrant, too), so that rules work heavy lifting has been done already.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":10}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5-richt","name":"RichT","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5_2.jpeg","title":"Onyx Path Creative Director","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"505"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-09T12:44:25-08:00","id":1279762,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1279418-scion-2e-demigod-official?p=1279634#post1279634\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> However, WHOLE POINT of Scion 2E was that mechanics for Demigod and God to be fixed. I suspect, they need to put special care for playtesting those books when written.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yes, but the heavy lifting is done via Scale already being a printed thing in that regard.<br /> <br /> Edit: Oh! What RichT said.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-08-03T02:00:20-07:00","id":1329082,"title":"","content":"It's OLD post ( from year 2016 ) but there is mention here for planned Pantheons in 2E <b>Demigod</b>:<br /> <br /> 'And when we do get to Demigod, I really want to sink my teeth into Mesopotamian, Polynesian, Slavic\u2026lots of myth to choose from.'<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/pantheons-scion-second-edition-open-development/\" target=\"_blank\">http://theonyxpath.com/pantheons-sci...n-development/</a><br /> <br /> I was thinking we see a Persian Yazata in <b>Demigod</b>, but cannot find source for it...<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 08-03-2019, 05:02 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-08-03T02:05:12-07:00","id":1329083,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1279418-scion-2e-demigod-official?p=1329082#post1329082\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It's OLD post ( from year 2016 ) but there is mention here for planned Pantheons in 2E <b>Demigod</b>:<br /> <br /> 'And when we do get to Demigod, I really want to sink my teeth into Mesopotamian, Polynesian, Slavic\u2026lots of myth to choose from.'<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/pantheons-scion-second-edition-open-development/\" target=\"_blank\">http://theonyxpath.com/pantheons-sci...n-development/</a><br /> <br /> I was thinking we see a Persian Yazata in <b>Demigod</b>, but cannot find source for it...</div> </div> </div> </div>That's a very old post. The Pantheons in Demigod are probably picked, but they haven't seen fit to release a full list.<br /> <br /> And the Yazata are going to be in the Companion. Along with the Loa (the Voodoo religion) and the Nemetondevos (the Gods of the Gaulish people)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Disclaimer: In favor of fun and enjoyment, but may speak up to warn you that you're gonna step on a metaphorical land mine","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2142-kyman201","name":"Kyman201","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2142_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-08-04T09:12:23-07:00","id":1329293,"title":"","content":"Info on <b>Demigod</b> from Pathcast <a href=\"https://onyxpathcast.podbean.com/e/episode-62-scion-deep-dive/\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Scion</b> 2E Deep Dive</a> with <b>Scion</b> lead developer, Neall Raemonn Price:<ol class=\"decimal\"><li>49:30 \u2013 General thoughts on 2E <b>Demigod</b> idea \u2013 In 2E heroes <i>can</i> die happy \u2013 demigods are slowly throwing out their mortality and start <i>their own</i> <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Labours_of_Hercules\" target=\"_blank\">\u2019Twelve Labours of Hercules</a>\u2019 ( or similar great tests ) for earning Legend to become gods after their final death. But made a mistake \u2013 and you simply die, not becoming god. Some great event start this path at Legend 4 for the Scion.</li> <li>53:00 \u2013 <b>Julius Caesar as example of demigod that died ( killed by Brutus ) to become god! </b>:-O</li> <li>54:30 \u2013 More Pantheons, more Terra Incognita in book \u2013 In new book there will be shown mostly Underworlds, as they are most missed in mythic stories ( but the will be other Terra\u2019s also ).</li> <li>56:50 \u2013 New mechanics in <b>Demigod</b> \u2013<b> Collateral i Divinity Pool </b>\u2013 First is mechanics analogical for those with <b>Aberrant </b>that are about damages of your godly powers do to surroundings. Divinity Pool is not explained more beside than name \u2013 but it\u2019s something like \u2018super dices\u2019, helping with rolls?</li> <li>57:30 \u2013 New mechanics in <b>Demigod, part 2 </b>\u2013 New power categories - <b>Dominion Boon</b> \u2013 Powers of demigods pointing to what god you will be, finally\u2013 Agni is Fire, Hercules is Strength. They are not extra powers \u2013 but they also let Dominion do new Stunts for everything around \u2013 for example, those around Fire Dominion makes that everything is much more flammable, and emotions raising easier. There is direct example in Death Dominion \u2013 powers are: you can resurrect someone as zombie, you know when other die, you can easier death of someone, or that everything around you becomes much more deadlier \u2013 even non-lethal bruises.</li> </ol>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 08-04-2019, 04:30 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-08-20T11:54:14-07:00","id":1331821,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/some-qs-some-as-monday-meeting-notes/\" target=\"_blank\">By this Monday Meeting blog </a>- <b>Scion 2E: Demigod</b> &amp; <b>Titanomachy</b> are in Second Draft! Mark me intrigued - maybe in next year we get the books...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-08-20T12:11:24-07:00","id":1331823,"title":"",